  "2026-10-05T05:56:44.011Z",codex-sol,"Verified the shared 17 command/transport tests within the 86-test all-source suite: real TypeSafe SDK HTTP, host extension harness, and isolated real pm projects. All source coverage dimensions are 100%; live local tev1 schema/plausibility and packed npm/Bun installation acceptance passed. Implementation and receipts are linked in README.md and docs/v0-validation.md. Leaving this item in progress for orchestrator verification and closure."
  "2026-10-11T05:14:56.691Z",codex-sol,"Acceptance met on main 7c0f0e0: index.ts:1367 runGateCommand requires exactly one text/item source, validates threshold and computes the noul verdict inclusively with host-owned exit_code=1 on mismatch. Tests: ask, dedupe, gate and discovery dispatch on a real temporary tracker (test/decisions.test.ts:88); near-threshold gate output preserves the probability used for its exit code (test/transport.test.ts:135). Default thresholds remain provisional. Fresh main acceptance: node --test test/agent-ux.test.ts test/decisions.test.ts test/transport.test.ts test/release-workflow.test.ts test/calibration.test.ts passed 51/51, zero failures/skips. Tracker schema has no review status, so status stays in_progress; not closed. Cross-reference docs/tracker-reconciliation.md; line numbers refer to checked main."
